+**Bi-pencil `S_4` escape monodromy.** For a pinned `N=4` skeleton, restrict `F` to
+generic vertical and horizontal target lines. On a vertical line `P=c`, the
+Hamiltonian field `X_P` satisfies `X_P(Q)=1`; its incomplete trajectories escape
+at the finite set `A_F cap {P=c}`. Analytic continuation around those escape
